"L67"><span begin="4:04.608" end="4:04.813">ai</span><span begin="4:04.813" end="4:05.068">ya</span><span begin="4:05.068" end="4:05.646">iya</span><span begin="4:05.646" end="4:05.878">ai</span><span begin="4:05.878" end="4:06.154">ya</span><span begin="4:06.154" end="4:06.582">iya</span></text><text for="L68"><span begin="4:08.938" end="4:09.142">ai</span><span begin="4:09.142" end="4:09.412">ya</span><span begin="4:09.412" end="4:10.024">iya</span><span begin="4:10.024" end="4:10.240">ai</span><span begin="4:10.240" end="4:10.516">ya</span><span begin="4:10.516" end="4:10.936">iya</span></text><text for="L69"><span begin="4:13.372" end="4:13.543">ai</span><span begin="4:13.543" end="4:13.771">ya</span><span begin="4:13.771" end="4:14.402">iya</span><span begin="4:14.402" end="4:14.618">ai</span><span begin="4:14.618" end="4:14.878">ya</span><span begin="4:14.878" end="4:15.495">iya</span></text><text for="L70"><span begin="4:17.713" end="4:17.907">ai</span><span begin="4:17.907" end="4:18.150">ya</span><span begin="4:18.150" end="4:18.822">iya</span><span begin="4:18.822" end="4:19.023">ai</span><span begin="4:19.023" end="4:19.260">ya</span><span begin="4:19.260" end="4:19.676">iya</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>DECO*27</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:21.992"><div begin="8.107" end="58.236" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="8.107" end="8.821" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.107" end="8.323">言っ</span><span begin="8.323" end="8.622">ちゃっ</span><span begin="8.622" end="8.821">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">惨了 不小心吐露心声了</span></p><p begin="8.863" end="10.846" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.863" end="9.019">も</span><span begin="9.019" end="9.148">う</span><span begin="9.148" end="9.446">一</span><span begin="9.446" end="9.596">時</span><span begin="9.596" end="9.740">だ</span><span begin="9.740" end="9.886">け</span><span begin="9.886" end="10.114">隣</span><span begin="10.114" end="10.262">り</span><span begin="10.262" end="10.465">に</span><span begin="10.465" end="10.546">居</span><span begin="10.546" end="10.651">た</span><span begin="10.651" end="10.846">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">求你 再在身边陪我一会儿好不好</span></p><p begin="10.966" end="13.095" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.966" end="11.083">い</span><span begin="11.083" end="11.227">や</span><span begin="11.227" end="11.328">い</span><span begin="11.328" end="11.484">や</span><span begin="11.484" end="11.592">ま</span><span begin="11.592" end="11.712">さ</span><span begin="11.712" end="11.884">か</span> <span begin="11.884" end="12.166">延</span><span begin="12.166" end="12.364">長</span><span begin="12.364" end="12.535">は</span><span begin="12.535" end="12.708">鬱</span><span begin="12.708" end="12.852">雑</span><span begin="12.852" end="13.095">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">啊 开什么玩笑 死缠烂打也太恶心了吧</span></p><p begin="13.110" end="14.972" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.110" end="13.294">御</span><span begin="13.294" end="13.547">免</span><span begin="13.547" end="13.643">な</span><span begin="13.643" end="13.738">さ</span><span begin="13.738" end="13.985">い</span> <span begin="14.219" end="14.645">帰っ</span><span begin="14.645" end="14.759">て</span><span begin="14.759" end="14.972">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">对不起啦 你赶紧滚回家吧</span></p><p begin="15.258" end="17.289" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.258" end="15.494">二</span><span begin="15.494" end="15.722">酸</span><span begin="15.722" end="15.830">化</span><span begin="15.830" end="15.992">の</span><span begin="15.992" end="16.224">炭</span><span begin="16.224" end="16.368">素</span> <span begin="16.368" end="16.521">き</span><span begin="16.521" end="16.619">み</span><span begin="16.619" end="16.769">の</span><span begin="16.769" end="17.054">濃</span><span begin="17.054" end="17.289">度</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这屋里全是你呼出的废气 那是你的浓度</span></p><p begin="17.504" end="19.565" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.504" end="17.887">浸っ</span><span begin="17.887" end="18.055">て</span><span begin="18.055" end="18.152">た</span><span begin="18.152" end="18.302">い</span><span begin="18.302" end="18.458">よ</span> <span begin="18.458" end="18.716">泥</span><span begin="18.716" end="18.987">沼</span><span begin="18.987" end="19.112">の</span><span begin="19.112" end="19.388">夢</span><span begin="19.388" end="19.565">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好想就这样烂死在这个浑浊不堪的烂泥梦里</span></p><p begin="19.674" end="21.796" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.674" end="19.821">身</span><span begin="19.821" end="20.016">勝</span><span begin="20.016" end="20.160">手</span><span begin="20.160" end="20.466">だっ</span><span begin="20.466" end="20.612">て</span><span begin="20.612" end="20.730">言</span><span begin="20.730" end="20.874">わ</span><span begin="20.874" end="20.991">れ</span><span begin="20.991" end="21.138">て</span><span begin="21.138" end="21.317">も</span><span begin="21.317" end="21.435">ペ</span><span begin="21.435" end="21.564">ロ</span><span begin="21.564" end="21.796">リ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算被骂死任性 我也要吐出舌头对你作怪</span></p><p begin="21.870" end="23.787" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.870" end="22.010">不</span><span begin="22.010" end="22.217">安</span><span begin="22.217" end="22.361">じゃ</span><span begin="22.361" end="22.467">な</span><span begin="22.467" end="22.685">い</span> <span begin="22.941" end="23.117">未</span><span begin="23.117" end="23.343">来</span><span begin="23.343" end="23.484">は</span><span begin="23.484" end="23.613">な</span><span begin="23.613" end="23.787">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我才没有不安呢 反正我们根本没有未来</span></p><p begin="23.893" end="26.588" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.893" end="24.198">そ</span><span begin="24.198" end="24.318">の</span><span begin="24.318" end="24.558">顔</span><span begin="24.558" end="24.725">に</span><span begin="24.725" end="24.842">生</span><span begin="24.842" end="24.965">ま</span><span begin="24.965" end="25.092">れ</span><span begin="25.092" end="25.242">変</span><span begin="25.242" end="25.376">わ</span><span begin="25.376" end="25.506">り</span><span begin="25.506" end="25.622">た</span><span begin="25.622" end="25.826">い</span><span begin="25.826" end="26.127">な</span> <span begin="26.127" end="26.356">Ah-</span><span begin="26.356" end="26.588">ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">真想把我这身皮剥了 整容成你的这张脸啊</span></p><p begin="34.190" end="34.983" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.190" end="34.452">知っ</span><span begin="34.452" end="34.764">ちゃっ</span><span begin="34.764" end="34.983">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我可算彻底看透了</span></p><p begin="35.061" end="37.040" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.061" end="35.322">大</span><span begin="35.322" end="35.629">嫌</span><span begin="35.629" end="35.798">い</span><span begin="35.798" end="35.917">を</span><span begin="35.917" end="36.152">裏</span><span begin="36.152" end="36.413">返</span><span begin="36.413" end="36.542">し</span><span begin="36.542" end="36.661">た</span><span begin="36.661" end="36.850">と</span><span begin="36.850" end="37.040">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算把对你的恨之入骨翻个面</span></p><p begin="37.108" end="39.233" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.108" end="37.268">そ</span><span begin="37.268" end="37.406">こ</span><span begin="37.406" end="37.522">に</span><span begin="37.522" end="37.754">大</span><span begin="37.754" end="37.858">好</span><span begin="37.858" end="38.041">き</span><span begin="38.041" end="38.180">は</span><span begin="38.180" end="38.455">隠</span><span begin="38.455" end="38.587">れ</span><span begin="38.587" end="38.725">て</span><span begin="38.725" end="38.881">な</span><span begin="38.881" end="39.029">い</span><span begin="39.029" end="39.233">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">底下也根本没有藏着一丝一毫的爱意</span></p><p begin="39.299" end="41.240" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.299" end="39.669">叶</span><span begin="39.669" end="39.825">え</span><span begin="39.825" end="39.939">た</span><span begin="39.939" end="40.092">い</span> <span begin="40.424" end="40.547">こ</span><span begin="40.547" end="40.791">の</span><span begin="40.791" end="41.085">想</span><span begin="41.085" end="41.240">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好想实现这份沉重的心意</span></p><p begin="41.510" end="43.466" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.510" end="41.767">甘</span><span begin="41.767" end="41.906">え</span><span begin="41.906" end="42.033">過</span><span begin="42.033" end="42.186">ぎ</span><span begin="42.186" end="42.444">太</span><span begin="42.444" end="42.570">る</span><span begin="42.570" end="42.976">心</span><span begin="42.976" end="43.247">回</span><span begin="43.247" end="43.466">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">对你撒娇太甚 这颗心已经肿胀肥胖得不成样子</span></p><p begin="43.763" end="45.824" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.763" end="44.080">&quot;ファッ</span><span begin="44.080" end="44.318">ト</span><span begin="44.318" end="44.480">想</span><span begin="44.480" end="44.618">い→</span><span begin="44.618" end="44.746">ス</span><span begin="44.746" end="44.876">リ</span><span begin="44.876" end="45.031">ム&quot;</span><span begin="45.031" end="45.161">を</span><span begin="45.161" end="45.428">掲</span><span begin="45.428" end="45.549">げ</span><span begin="45.549" end="45.646">よ</span><span begin="45.646" end="45.824">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">干脆立个口号 把这病态膨胀的爱 抽脂抽到干瘪吧</span></p><p begin="45.899" end="48.160" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.899" end="45.989">出</span><span begin="45.989" end="46.217">逢っ</span><span begin="46.217" end="46.355">た</span><span begin="46.355" end="46.634">頃</span><span begin="46.634" end="46.775">と</span><span begin="46.775" end="47.036">同</span><span begin="47.036" end="47.180">じ</span><span begin="47.180" end="47.457">様</span><span begin="47.457" end="47.585">に</span><span begin="47.585" end="47.757">成</span><span begin="47.757" end="47.930">ろ</span><span begin="47.930" end="48.160">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我们变回刚认识时那样装模作样吧</span></p><p begin="48.184" end="49.900" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.184" end="48.427">思</span><span begin="48.427" end="48.500">い</span><span begin="48.500" end="48.629">笑</span><span begin="48.629" end="48.712">描</span><span begin="48.712" end="48.904">く</span><span begin="49.147" end="49.296">理</span><span begin="49.296" end="49.684">想</span><span begin="49.684" end="49.900">狂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">露出狰狞自嘲的笑 勾勒着癫狂的幻想</span></p><p begin="50.184" end="52.203" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.184" end="50.400">血</span><span begin="50.400" end="50.604">走</span><span begin="50.604" end="50.763">る</span><span begin="50.763" end="50.986">願</span><span begin="50.986" end="51.138">い</span><span begin="51.138" end="51.279">は</span><span begin="51.279" end="51.423">や</span><span begin="51.423" end="51.554">が</span><span begin="51.554" end="51.718">て</span><span begin="51.718" end="51.987">安</span><span begin="51.987" end="52.203">堵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">杀红了眼的执念 最终竟化作了病态的安宁</span></p><p begin="52.299" end="58.236" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.299" end="52.416">だ</span><span begin="52.416" end="52.542">け</span><span begin="52.542" end="53.100">ど</span><span begin="53.100" end="53.640">「大</span><span begin="53.640" end="54.101">丈</span><span begin="54.101" end="54.437">夫」</span><span begin="54.437" end="54.974">なん</span><span begin="54.974" end="55.206">て</span><span begin="55.206" end="55.781">恋</span><span begin="55.781" end="56.085">は</span><span begin="56.085" end="56.389">ど</span><span begin="56.389" end="56.589">こ</span><span begin="56.589" end="56.878">に</span><span begin="56.878" end="57.751">も</span><span begin="57.751" end="57.865">な</span><span begin="57.865" end="58.011">い</span><span begin="58.011" end="58.236">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可是啊 万事大吉的恋爱在这个破世界上根本就不存在</span></p></div><div begin="58.303" end="1:33.839" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="58.303" end="1:01.153" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.303" end="58.540">だ</span><span begin="58.540" end="58.738">か</span><span begin="58.738" end="59.071">ら</span><span begin="59.071" end="59.293">妄</span><span begin="59.293" end="59.569">想</span> <span begin="59.569" end="59.851">感</span><span begin="59.851" end="1:00.155">傷</span> <span begin="1:00.155" end="1:00.373">代</span><span begin="1:00.373" end="1:00.679">償</span> <span begin="1:00.679" end="1:00.911">連</span><span begin="1:00.911" end="1:01.153">盟</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以只能靠着狂乱的妄想 自残般的感伤 惨痛的代价与苟合</span></p><p begin="1:01.246" end="1:03.459" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.246" end="1:01.567">愛</span><span begin="1:01.567" end="1:01.835">を</span><span begin="1:01.835" end="1:01.929">懐</span><span begin="1:01.929" end="1:02.073">い</span><span begin="1:02.073" end="1:02.232">て</span><span begin="1:02.232" end="1:02.358">理</span><span begin="1:02.358" end="1:02.622">想</span><span begin="1:02.622" end="1:02.799">を</span><span begin="1:02.799" end="1:03.198">号ん</span><span begin="1:03.198" end="1:03.459">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">死死怀抱爱情 歇斯底里地高喊虚无的理想</span></p><p begin="1:03.725" end="1:07.199" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.725" end="1:03.974">行</span><span begin="1:03.974" end="1:04.230">き</span><span begin="1:04.230" end="1:04.496">場</span><span begin="1:04.496" end="1:04.762">の</span><span begin="1:04.762" end="1:05.036">な</span><span begin=